        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Alphabet 2025 Annual Report — Financial Results</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['\\\\(', '\\\\)']],\n    displayMath: [['\\\\[', '\\\\]']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    color: #424242;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 1650px;\n    min-height: 2150px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 125px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .top-nav {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 64px;\n    left: 125px;\n    right: 125px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    color: #202124;\n  }\n\n  .top-nav span:nth-child(1) {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .top-nav span:nth-child(2),\n  .top-nav span:nth-child(3) {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .top-nav span:nth-child(4) {\n    text-align: right;\n    padding-right: 44px;\n  }\n\n  .top-nav .active {\n    color: #d94242;\n  }\n\n  main {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 169px;\n    left: 125px;\n    width: 1400px;\n  }\n\n  .bullet-list {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 27px;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 1.34;\n  }\n\n  .bullet-list li {\n    margin: 0 0 5px 0;\n    padding-left: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .bullet-list li::marker {\n    color: #9a9a9a;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n\n  h2 {\n    margin: 22px 0 13px 0;\n    color: #5d5d5d;\n    font-size: 33px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.12;\n  }\n\n  .other-list {\n    margin-top: 0;\n  }\n\n  .other-list li {\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n\n  .outlook {\n    margin: 22px 0 0 0;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 1.34;\n  }\n\n  .financial-title {\n    margin: 24px 0 20px 0;\n    color: #db3d3d;\n    font-size: 37px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .revenues-title {\n    margin: 0 0 19px 0;\n    color: #db3d3d;\n    font-size: 36px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .table-intro {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    margin-top: 37px;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n    color: #535353;\n    font-size: 23px;\n    line-height: 1.08;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table col.label {\n    width: 62%;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table col.year {\n    width: 19%;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table th {\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table thead .period-row th {\n    height: 31px;\n    padding: 0 0 7px 0;\n    vertical-align: bottom;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table thead .period-row .period {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #777777;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #333333;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table thead .year-row th {\n    height: 43px;\n    padding: 9px 8px 7px 8px;\n    text-align: right;\n    color: #333333;\n    border-bottom: 3px solid #9b9b9b;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table thead .year-row th:first-child {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table tbody tr {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #777777;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table tbody th,\n  .revenue-table tbody td {\n    height: 43px;\n    padding: 8px 9px 6px 9px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table tbody th {\n    text-align: left;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table tbody td {\n    text-align: right;\n    letter-spacing: 0.4px;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table .indent-1 {\n    padding-left: 38px;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table .indent-2 {\n    padding-left: 66px;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table .total-label {\n    padding-left: 52px;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table .section-total {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #777777;\n  }\n\n  .revenue-table .grand-total {\n    border-bottom: 3px double #777777;\n  }\n\n  .accounting {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 22px 1fr;\n    width: 100%;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .accounting .currency {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .accounting .amount {\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 1203px;\n    top: 2052px;\n    width: 322px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    color: #242424;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .footer .brand {\n    color: #df4545;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <nav class=\"top-nav\" aria-label=\"Report sections\">\n    <span>Part I</span>\n    <span class=\"active\">Part II</span>\n    <span>Part III</span>\n    <span>Part IV</span>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main>\n    <ul class=\"bullet-list\">\n      <li>Cost of revenues was $162.5 billion, an increase of 11% year over year, primarily driven by increases in TAC, content<br>acquisition costs, and depreciation expense.</li>\n      <li>Operating expenses were $111.3 billion, an increase of 22% year over year, primarily driven by increases in employee<br>compensation expenses, expenses related to legal and other matters, and depreciation expense.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>Other Information:</h2>\n\n    <ul class=\"bullet-list other-list\">\n      <li>In 2025, we entered into definitive agreements to acquire Wiz, a leading cloud security platform, for $32.0 billion, and<br>Intersect, a provider of data center and energy infrastructure solutions, for $4.8 billion in cash plus the assumption of<br>debt. Both acquisitions are expected to close in 2026, subject to customary closing conditions, including the receipt of<br>regulatory approvals.</li>\n      <li>In 2025, we issued senior unsecured notes for net proceeds of $37.3 billion, to be used for general corporate purposes.</li>\n      <li>OI&amp;E of $29.8 billion for the year ended December 31, 2025 included net gains on equity securities of $24.1 billion,<br>primarily related to unrealized gains on our non-marketable equity securities.</li>\n      <li>Other Bets operating loss of $7.5 billion for the year ended December 31, 2025 included a $2.1 billion employee<br>compensation charge recognized in the fourth quarter for Waymo, primarily reflected in research and development<br>expenses, based on estimated stock valuation. In February 2026, Waymo announced an investment round of $16.0 billion,<br>the significant majority of which was funded by Alphabet.</li>\n      <li>Changes to U.S. tax law enacted on July 4, 2025, allow, among other things, for immediate expensing of domestic<br>research and experimentation costs and accelerated depreciation on eligible capital expenditures, the effects of which<br>are included in operating cash flows for the year ended December 31, 2025.</li>\n      <li>Repurchases of Class A and Class C shares were $6.5 billion and $38.9 billion, respectively, totaling $45.4 billion for the<br>year ended December 31, 2025.</li>\n      <li>Operating cash flow was $164.7 billion for the year ended December 31, 2025.</li>\n      <li>Capital expenditures, which primarily reflected investments in technical infrastructure, were $91.4 billion for the year<br>ended December 31, 2025.</li>\n      <li>As of December 31, 2025, we had 190,820 employees.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p class=\"outlook\">We are monitoring ongoing developments surrounding international trade and the macroeconomic environment. As a result<br>of volatility in international trade and financial markets, we may experience direct and indirect effects on our business,<br>operations, and financial results. Our past results may not be indicative of our future performance, and our financial results<br>may differ materially from historical trends.</p>\n\n    <h1 class=\"financial-title\">Financial Results</h1>\n    <h2 class=\"revenues-title\">Revenues</h2>\n    <p class=\"table-intro\">The following table presents revenues by type (in millions):</p>\n\n    <table class=\"revenue-table\" aria-label=\"Revenues by type in millions\">\n      <colgroup>\n        <col class=\"label\">\n        <col class=\"year\">\n        <col class=\"year\">\n      </colgroup>\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"period-row\">\n          <th></th>\n          <th class=\"period\" colspan=\"2\">Year Ended December 31,</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"year-row\">\n          <th></th>\n          <th>2024</th>\n          <th>2025</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"indent-1\">Google Search &amp; other</th>\n          <td>\n            <span class=\"accounting\"><span class=\"currency\">$</span><span class=\"amount\">198,084</span></span>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <span class=\"accounting\"><span class=\"currency\">$</span><span class=\"amount\">224,532</span></span>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"indent-1\">YouTube ads</th>\n          <td>36,147</td>\n          <td>40,367</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"indent-1\">Google Network</th>\n          <td>30,359</td>\n          <td>29,792</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"indent-2\">Google advertising</th>\n          <td>264,590</td>\n          <td>294,691</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"section-total\">\n          <th class=\"indent-1\">Google subscriptions, platforms, and devices</th>\n          <td>40,340</td>\n          <td>48,030</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Google Services total</th>\n          <td>304,930</td>\n          <td>342,721</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Google Cloud</th>\n          <td>43,229</td>\n          <td>58,705</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Other Bets</th>\n          <td>1,648</td>\n          <td>1,537</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Hedging gains (losses)</th>\n          <td>211</td>\n          <td>(127)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"grand-total\">\n          <th class=\"total-label\">Total revenues</th>\n          <td>\n            <span class=\"accounting\"><span class=\"currency\">$</span><span class=\"amount\">350,018</span></span>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <span class=\"accounting\"><span class=\"currency\">$</span><span class=\"amount\">402,836</span></span>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <span><span class=\"brand\">Alphabet</span> 2025 Annual Report</span>\n    <span>31</span>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
